+Subject: [PATCH] mtd: qcomsmem: allow only verified H5 boot/system upgrade children
+
+The H5 parent stays read-only. Only the installer/production compatible
+and the exact verified 512 MiB map permit two writable children. Parser
+failure cannot expose a writable master. All firmware/calibration, boot
+loader, recovery and userdata partitions retain read-only flags.
+
+--- a/drivers/mtd/parsers/qcomsmempart.c
